  quote={'text': 'Network coding has been my life’s work.', 'who': 'Muriel Médard, 11 December 2025', 'url': 'https://www.getoptimum.xyz/blog/optimum-ceo-muriel-medard-receives-prestigious-ieee-richard-w-hamming-medal'},
